      en: ["Diameter: approximately 3 km (1.9 mi)", "Formation: about 2,500 years ago", "Crater floor elevation: approx. 2,800 m (9,186 ft)", "Average temperature: 18 °C (64 °F)", "Protected area: Pululahua Geobotanical Reserve since 1966", "Distance from Quito: 33 km (20.5 mi)"],
